==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Champion's Path|Machoke|25}} from the {{TCG|Champion's Path}} expansion.
*'''Chop''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Gym Challenge|Giovanni's Machop|72}} from the {{TCG|Gym Challenge}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Shield}}.

